## Problem
Same as Goal 9, but for float-precision bridge functions.

Expected test outputs:
```
bridge___rem_pio2f_internal([0x1.4p+2], e0=0, nx=1) = 3 y=[0x1.26838p-2, 0x1.99bc5cp-27]
bridge___rem_pio2f_internal([0x1p+0], e0=2, nx=1) = 3 y=[-0x1.6cbe4p-1, 0x1.99bc5cp-27]
bridge___tanf 0x1p-1 0x0p+0 1 = 0x1.17b4f6p-1
bridge___tanf 0x1p-1 0x0p+0 -1 = -0x1.d49ad8p+0
bridge___tanf 0x0p+0 0x0p+0 1 = 0x0p+0
bridge___ctansf(0x1p+0+0x1p+0i) = 0x1.ac4b54p+1
bridge___ctansf(0x0p+0+0x1p-1i) = 0x1.160eacp-1
bridge___sin_pif 0x1p-1 = 0x1p+0
bridge___sin_pif 0x1p+0 = -0x0p+0
bridge___sin_pif 0x1p-2 = 0x1.6a09e8p-1
bridge___sin_pif -0x1p-1 = -0x1p+0
```

## What Needs to Change
Add `#[no_mangle] pub extern "C"` bridge wrapper functions in lib.rs for the
float-precision internal functions.

## Success Criteria
- All 11 test cases above produce bitwise-exact output matching C
